<title>KUWAIT: KNPC plans jet fuel unit at al-Ahmadi refinery.</title>
<headline>KNPC plans jet fuel unit at al-Ahmadi refinery.</headline>
<dateline>KUWAIT 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>State oil refiner Kuwait National Petroleum Co (KNPC) plans to build a jet fuel unit at its al-Ahmadi refinery in 1998, a newspaper reported on Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;Under increased demand for jet fuel KNPC will build a new unit in al-Ahmad refinery next year,&quot; al-Anba quoted Abdul- Rahman al-Taweel, KNPC's deputy managing director, as saying.</p>
<p>&quot;There will also be amendments to the jet fuel processing unit in al-Shuaiba refinery,&quot; he added.</p>
<p>&quot;The two projects have actually been approved,&quot; he said without giving further details.</p>
</text>
